OL,3,GNEWSA'I didn't think I'd become a pub
OL,4,Alandlord aged 20'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt an age when most of his friends are
OL,7,Fjust starting out in their careers,
OL,8,FWill Avery is running his own village
OL,9,Fpub.
OL,11,FThe 20-year-old has become the landlord
OL,12,Fand head chef of the Cross Keys Pub and
OL,13,FRestaurant in Upwood, Cambridgeshire,
OL,14,Fafter working his way up from being in
OL,15,Fthe kitchen.
OL,17,F"It's fun, it's challenging, but it is
OL,18,Freally good," he said.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
