OL,3,GNEWSA'I didn't think I'd become a pub
OL,4,Alandlord aged 20'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said his friends were "pretty
OL,7,Fjealous" of his new role, adding:
OL,8,F"Absolutely no way at any point would I
OL,9,Fhave thought I would have been where I
OL,10,Fam now."
